OL,3,GNEWSASeafront wheel lease jeopardises  
OL,4,Ai360, owner says                       
OL,6,FThe owner of the Brighton i360 says she
OL,7,Fis "really worried about the future" of
OL,8,Fthe attraction after a lease was       
OL,9,Fgranted for a seafront ferris wheel to 
OL,10,Freturn.                                
OL,12,FSarah Willingham, who bought the       
OL,13,Fviewing tower in 2024 after it went    
OL,14,Finto administration, says Brighton and 
OL,15,FHove City Council have "put the future 
OL,16,Fof the i360 in jeopardy" by granting a 
OL,17,F25-year lease for the Brighton Wheel to
OL,18,Freturn as early as 2027.               
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
