OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASeafront wheel lease jeopardises  
OL,4,Ai360, owner says                       
OL,6,FWillingham, speaking ahead of a meeting
OL,7,Fto discuss the lessons learned from the
OL,8,Fcouncil's involvement in the i360's    
OL,9,Ffinances, said Brighton "can't sustain"
OL,10,Ftwo paid viewing attractions.          
OL,12,FCouncil deputy leader Jacob Taylor said
OL,13,Fthe wheel will bring a "strong         
OL,14,Ffinancial income to the council".      
